   "options": "<h4>Signup Email Placeholders</h4>\n<pre>\nWelcome to {{ institution_name }}\n\nDear {{ full_name }},\n\nYour account has been successfully created.\nPlease click the link below to set your password:\n\n{{ set_password_link }}\n\nThis link is valid for {{ link_expiry_hours }} hours.\n\nLogin here: {{ login_url }}\n\nFor support, contact: {{ support_email }}\n</pre>\n\n<h4>Available Placeholders</h4>\n<p>The following placeholders can be used in your Signup Email Subject and Signup Email Template fields.</p>\n\n<table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"5\" cellspacing=\"0\">\n    <thead>\n        <tr>\n            <th>Placeholder</th>\n            <th>Value</th>\n        </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n        <tr><td>{{ institution_name }}</td><td>Institution name from Institution profile</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>{{ logo }}</td><td>Institution logo from Institution profile</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>{{ full_name }}</td><td>Applicant's full name</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>{{ set_password_link }}</td><td>Auto-generated secure password setup link</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>{{ login_url }}</td><td>Login page URL configured above</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>{{ support_email }}</td><td>Support email configured above</td></tr>\n        <tr><td>{{ link_expiry_hours }}</td><td>Link expiry hours configured above</td></tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h4>Templating</h4>\n<p>Templates are compiled using the Jinja Templating Language. To learn more about Jinja, \n<a class=\"strong\" href=\"http://jinja.pocoo.org/docs/dev/templates/\">read this documentation.</a></p>"
